   "text": "1. PERSIST the key (before the 1st attempt)\n2. call the API with header\n    Idempotency-Key: <that key>\n3. after a crash, REUSE the stored key",
   "originalText": "1. PERSIST the key (before the 1st attempt)\n2. call the API with header\n    Idempotency-Key: <that key>\n3. after a crash, REUSE the stored key",
