   "text": "BEGIN;\nINSERT INTO processed (op_id) VALUES ($1) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING RETURNING op_id;\n-- only if a row came back:\nUPDATE counters SET n = n + 1 WHERE key = $2;\nCOMMIT;",
