   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "After a crash: read the last recorded state and continue from there. A crash between an action and its state update repeats that action, so it still needs the derived\nkey.",
   "originalText": "After a crash: read the last recorded state and continue from there. A crash between an action and its state update repeats that action, so it still needs the derived\nkey.",
